productive bee gene automation

Name "Productive Bee Gene Automation"

Every tick do
    Input fe:: from EnderCell
    Output fe:: to Breeder, Incubator, Centrifuge
End

Every 20 ticks do
    -- Input for Chorus Flowers
    Input chorus_flower from Interface
    Output retain 2 to each Breeder slots 3
    Output retain 2 to each Breeder slots 4
Forget
    -- Input for glass bottles
    Input glass_bottle from Interface
    Output retain 10 to each Bottler slots 0
Forget
    --Input for Honey Treats
    Input honey_treat from Interface
    Output retain 40 to each Incubator slots 1
Forget
    -- Cages to be pushed back in rotation
    Input sturdy_bee_cage from Drawer
    Output retain 5 to each Breeder slots 0
Forget
    -- Cages to be taken from Gene Barrel back to drawer
    Input sturdy_bee_cage from Gene_Barrel
    Output to Drawer
Forget
    -- Take baby bees from breeder into incubator
    Input from Breeder slots 5
    Output to Incubator slots 0
Forget
    -- Take grown bees from incubator to Dispenser (Last Crushing Step)
    Input from Incubator slots 2
    Output to Dispenser
Forget
    -- Take gene samples from gene barrel to centrifuge
    Input from Gene_Barrel
    Output to Centrifuge slots 1
Forget
    --Take Separated genes from centrifuge to indexer
    Input from Centrifuge slots 2-10
    Output to Indexer
End
